{"id": "t135-060", "text": "Seo-yeon called - wedding prep chaos. her florist cancelled last min, her mum's arriving from Seoul next Tues at 6am & Seo-yeon is v anxious about getting everything sorted before. her brother Min-jun is handling the music. she's still after a stand mixer hint hint. remind me to ask her about the florist sometime next wk & offer to help w/ table decor on the Sat", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Seo-yeon", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "florist", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "arriving from Seoul", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Tues at 6am", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Seo-yeon", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "anxious", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "before", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Min-jun", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "after a stand mixer", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask her about the florist", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "florist", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next wk", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "offer to help w/ table decor", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Sat", "anchor": "a2"}]}
